    {
      "id": "u_2279e08034b5f8a5c9585785_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Theme__TRILIUM_PH_1__ submenu changes the look of the application without opening the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Options__TRILIUM_PH_3__. A check mark at the end of a row shows the active choice. The submenu is not shown on mobile; change the theme from __TRILIUM_PH_4__Options__TRILIUM_PH_5__ → __TRILIUM_PH_6__Appearance__TRILIUM_PH_7__ there.",
      "sourceHash": "2279e08034b5f8a5c9585785c836f56c92de25ea7de9b5569e0e347480d9b615",
      "context": "Global menu > Switching the theme",
      "contextHash": "8661e4321d93524a654b1e8fdd08f0d1ba77357fef6f4c59e19f6fc305c42c30",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7771877ea326a8a9a2aaf1bf_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Under __TRILIUM_PH_0__Color scheme__TRILIUM_PH_1__, choose __TRILIUM_PH_2__System__TRILIUM_PH_3__ to follow the light or dark mode of the operating system, or __TRILIUM_PH_4__Light__TRILIUM_PH_5__ or __TRILIUM_PH_6__Dark__TRILIUM_PH_7__ to use one regardless.",
      "sourceHash": "7771877ea326a8a9a2aaf1bfe26bbd165ab03c07525b266124cd547698bc8715",
      "context": "Global menu > Switching the theme",
      "contextHash": "8661e4321d93524a654b1e8fdd08f0d1ba77357fef6f4c59e19f6fc305c42c30",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_34dc0b01056c237bed29dd7a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Under __TRILIUM_PH_0__Theme__TRILIUM_PH_1__, choose __TRILIUM_PH_2__Modern__TRILIUM_PH_3__ (the default theme) or one of the custom themes, each shown with the icon of its note. Switching to __TRILIUM_PH_4__Modern__TRILIUM_PH_5__ keeps the current color scheme.",
      "sourceHash": "34dc0b01056c237bed29dd7a9aa353f600f41f474ba85b69dd0cf4bc12235430",
      "context": "Global menu > Switching the theme",
      "contextHash": "8661e4321d93524a654b1e8fdd08f0d1ba77357fef6f4c59e19f6fc305c42c30",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_72c3d6b539ccb95ea837ac70_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A custom theme brings its own colors, so the color schemes are unavailable while one is active. The legacy theme is not listed; select it from __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Appearance__TRILIUM_PH_3__ instead.",
      "sourceHash": "72c3d6b539ccb95ea837ac706b21efc662925574b294d50c1bea9b27215793d7",
      "context": "Global menu > Switching the theme",
      "contextHash": "8661e4321d93524a654b1e8fdd08f0d1ba77357fef6f4c59e19f6fc305c42c30",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
